WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:03.803
-And now it's time for
"Donald J. Trump

00:00:03.803 --> 00:00:06.539
and the Big Beautiful Wall."

00:00:06.539 --> 00:00:09.809
There once was a President
named Donald J. Trump.

00:00:09.809 --> 00:00:13.112
Donald loved to build things,
like skyscrapers

00:00:13.112 --> 00:00:15.048
and an angry fan base.

00:00:15.048 --> 00:00:16.982
But the one thing
he never got to build

00:00:16.982 --> 00:00:20.186
was a big, beautiful wall.

00:00:20.186 --> 00:00:23.656
The country said it was
a bad idea that wasted money,

00:00:23.656 --> 00:00:25.424
and that made Donald mad.

00:00:25.424 --> 00:00:28.994
So that night before bed,
he kneeled and prayed.

00:00:28.994 --> 00:00:32.031
-Dear Colonel Sanders,
I wish for the biggest,

00:00:32.031 --> 00:00:35.668
most beautiful wall
for my border.

00:00:35.668 --> 00:00:38.938
-The next morning, he woke up
and turned on Fox News,

00:00:38.938 --> 00:00:42.575
and here it was --
a brand-new wall on the border.

00:00:42.575 --> 00:00:44.977
Donald flew on Air Force One
to meet it,

00:00:44.977 --> 00:00:48.547
and when he got there,
he couldn't believe his eyes.

00:00:48.547 --> 00:00:53.452
The wall was 20 feet high,
hundreds of miles long,

00:00:53.452 --> 00:00:55.988
steel, but concrete,

00:00:55.988 --> 00:00:58.157
solid, but slats.

00:00:58.157 --> 00:01:00.726
Donald hugged the wall
and exclaimed...

00:01:00.726 --> 00:01:03.496
-Hello, my big, beautiful wall.

00:01:03.496 --> 00:01:05.298
Will you be my best friend?

00:01:05.298 --> 00:01:06.566
-Of course!

00:01:06.566 --> 00:01:07.800
-...said the wall.

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:11.871
-We will be best friends
and go on many adventures!

00:01:11.871 --> 00:01:13.572
Hop on!

00:01:13.572 --> 00:01:18.745
-So Donald jumped on the wall's
back and off they flew.

00:01:18.745 --> 00:01:21.814
-Let's go fight
the Great Wall of China.

00:01:21.814 --> 00:01:22.815
-...said Trump.

00:01:22.815 --> 00:01:24.183
The wall laughed.

00:01:24.183 --> 00:01:26.118
-[ Laughs ]
I can't go there.

00:01:26.118 --> 00:01:28.854
I have to fight crime
here in America.

00:01:28.854 --> 00:01:30.756
I have a better idea.

00:01:30.756 --> 00:01:32.992
-...said the wall
as it turned on its side

00:01:32.992 --> 00:01:35.728
and dipped down into
the Rio Grande River.

00:01:35.728 --> 00:01:38.498
-I could be the world's biggest
waterslide!

00:01:38.498 --> 00:01:40.433
-Wee!

00:01:40.433 --> 00:01:43.235
-...Donald exclaimed as he
slid down into the water.

00:01:43.235 --> 00:01:46.038
-Oh, no.
Oh, I forgot I can't swim.

00:01:46.038 --> 00:01:47.173
Help me, wall.

00:01:47.173 --> 00:01:48.574
-...shouted Donald.

00:01:48.574 --> 00:01:51.510
But the wall couldn't help him
and flew away.

00:01:51.510 --> 00:01:52.812
-Sorry, Donald.

00:01:52.812 --> 00:01:57.049
I'm off to stop refugee children
from crossing the border!

00:01:57.049 --> 00:02:00.286
-As Donald flailed in the water,
he woke up

00:02:00.286 --> 00:02:01.921
flailing in bed.

00:02:01.921 --> 00:02:03.656
Was it all a dream?

00:02:03.656 --> 00:02:05.959
Donald quickly turned on
Fox News

00:02:05.959 --> 00:02:09.228
and saw that there was no
big, beautiful wall.

00:02:09.228 --> 00:02:11.397
Sad!

00:02:11.397 --> 00:02:13.933
So Donald took
an executive time nap

00:02:13.933 --> 00:02:15.934
so he could once more
go on adventures

00:02:15.934 --> 00:02:19.205
with his best friend, the wall,
in his dreams.

00:02:19.205 --> 00:02:28.047 line:0%
♪♪

